# Findings

## High — Response arbitration remains unimplemented

The primary round-1 blocker is unchanged. `ResponseArbiter` is still not imported by `OpenAIAdapter`, while the adapter still owns the complete scheduler/cancellation/clear ledger and every field the phase package requires deleting. The module still has only one tool-follow-up smoke test and does not implement the required sequencing, cancellation attribution, late-clear, re-entrancy, fatal-close, or generation behavior. Phase 2 cannot pass while its largest ownership seam is unused and the documentation claims ownership it does not have.

